<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Motors upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Motors upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst David Garrity confirmed he upgraded General Motors Corp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Said he expects &quot;better earnings, substantially improved profit margins and improved cash flow&quot; from the automaker in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings estimate to $8.00 per share from $7.80.</p>
<p>-- 1997 operating cash flow estimate is $18 per share, up from an estimated $14.70 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- 12-month target price is $70 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/2 to 59-3/8 in early activity.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
